@template steady
// ZW1 (writer), patch 0.92.3 item 26: crew comment when you wear dirty clothes. clothes.remark: yesterday's clothes
// (flag:clothes.stale); clothes.grubby: a grubby uniform (flag:clothes.grubby, AC3). Bubbles, 60 characters or fewer.
// Kind, never mean: the joke is on the clothes, not on you.
== clothes.remark
? flag:clothes.stale
- That's yesterday's shirt. Change when you get a minute.
- Same clothes as yesterday? Easy fix. Wardrobe.
? flag:clothes.stale tier>=friend
- Everyone runs out once. The laundry sorts it.   #warm
== clothes.grubby
? flag:clothes.grubby
- You've worked hard. Your uniform says so.
- Grime on you. Change before you sit down to eat.
? flag:clothes.grubby tier>=friend
- Good shift? Change, wash, then eat. In that order.   #warm
